desc=Package mall for the Zan ecosystem: extensions (stdlib-layout libraries for the IDE) and apps (executables + licenses), with developer/admin review flows, points trading, RSA-SHA256 signed artifacts, and a version channel that keeps IDE / stdlib / compiler releases in step.
desc.zh=Zan 生态的扩展与程序商城：扩展（stdlib 布局库，IDE 内安装）与程序（可执行文件+许可证）两类商品，开发者/管理员审核流、积分交易、RSA-SHA256 包签名校验，以及同步 IDE / 标准库 / 编译器版本更新的版本频道。
